{"4713090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ai.ai", "steam_appid": 4713090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4890240], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713090/extras/22c1b82fa646d15ce51de7c70b96371e.avif?t=1782921506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713090/extras_big/22c1b82fa646d15ce51de7c70b96371e.webp?t=1782921506 width=1560 height=465 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The CEO of ai.ai has passed away, and his final word was &quot;bubble.&quot; Uncover the meaning of his final word in this adventure satirizing Silicon Valley.<br><br> Play as a reporter investigating the life of Thain, a biohacker AI billionaire. Journey through 14 distinct areas on your way to &quot;Thanadu,&quot; Thain's  mansion. Each area explores a different aspect of  AI and society through  essays, vignettes, dialogues, gags, and  musical numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk at your own pace and take in the jokes as they come, as if you were reading a comic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is also dotted with optional box-pushing puzzles. Solving these puzzles will earn you Thinking Tokens, which can be used to ask  AI to solve the game's central mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected playtime is 4-5 hours.<br> <br><strong>NOT MADE WITH AI. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -------------------------<br><br> <br>If you'd like, I can write a version with more oomph. Just say the word. ✅</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713090/extras/22c1b82fa646d15ce51de7c70b96371e.avif?t=1782921506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713090/extras_big/22c1b82fa646d15ce51de7c70b96371e.webp?t=1782921506 width=1560 height=465 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The CEO of ai.ai has passed away, and his final word was &quot;bubble.&quot; Uncover the meaning of his final word in this adventure satirizing Silicon Valley.<br><br> Play as a reporter investigating the life of Thain, a biohacker AI billionaire. Journey through 14 distinct areas on your way to &quot;Thanadu,&quot; Thain's  mansion. Each area explores a different aspect of  AI and society through  essays, vignettes, dialogues, gags, and  musical numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk at your own pace and take in the jokes as they come, as if you were reading a comic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is also dotted with optional box-pushing puzzles. Solving these puzzles will earn you Thinking Tokens, which can be used to ask  AI to solve the game's central mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected playtime is 4-5 hours.<br> <br><strong>NOT MADE WITH AI. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -------------------------<br><br> <br>If you'd like, I can write a version with more oomph. Just say the word. ✅</p>", "short_description": "The CEO of ai.ai has passed away, and his final word was &quot;bubble.&quot; Uncover the meaning of his final word in this comedy mystery satirizing Silicon Valley.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713090/713376255e92e6c6972ae594c34d00debaa9cd3f/header.jpg?t=1782921506", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713090/dbb24f973cd59c7476ba9a004976e3058d3f770d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782921506", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic